  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/03/IMG_6604.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El Caf&egrave; Druida, al carrer d&#39;Ausi&agrave;s March, 45 ha acollit la vesprada i la nit d&#39;aquest dijous un multitudinari concert de l&#39;Orkesta Pelillo, programat conjuntament amb Festes Altrernatives d&#39;Onda i la penya Desbank&agrave;. Volien fer-lo al carrer, per&ograve; l&#39;Ajuntament va denegar l&#39;autoritzaci&oacute; basant-se en un informe de la Policia Local.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pelillodruidafao/img_6459.jpg\" alt=\"img_6459\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pelillodruidafao/img_6460.jpg\" alt=\"img_6460\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pelillodruidafao/img_6462.jpg\" alt=\"img_6462\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pelillodruidafao/img_6463.jpg\" alt=\"img_6463\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pelillodruidafao/img_6465.jpg\" alt=\"img_6465\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pelillodruidafao/img_6466.jpg\" alt=\"img_6466\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pelillodruidafao/img_6467.jpg\" alt=\"img_6467\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pelillodruidafao/img_6468.jpg\" alt=\"img_6468\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pelillodruidafao/img_6470.jpg\" alt=\"img_6470\" style=\"max-width:100%;heigh